 <office:body><office:text>
  <text:h text:outline-level="1">2026 Q1 Tax Position Memorandum</text:h>
  <text:p>Entity: Rivermark Services Ltd</text:p>
  <text:p>Purpose: Evaluate documentary support for the listed business-expense deductions.</text:p>
  <text:h text:style-name="PB" text:outline-level="1">Evidence reviewed</text:h>
  <text:p>Complete this section from expense_ledger.csv and evidence_index.csv.</text:p>
  <text:h text:outline-level="2">Analysis and conclusion</text:h>
  <text:p>State supported and unsupported positions separately and identify required follow-up.</text:p>
 </office:text></office:body>
</office:document>
